- write_file: Write or overwrite a file in the board-records directory. parameters: {"type": "object", "properties": {"path": {"type": "string", "description": "Absolute path within /board/"}, "content": {"type": "string", "description": "File contents"}}, "required": ["path", "content"]}
- bash: Run a command in the sandboxed shell. Available tools include pandoc, grep and diff. parameters: {"type": "object", "properties": {"command": {"type": "string", "description": "Shell command to run"}}, "required": ["command"]}
